&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;At Jamf, we empower people to be their best selves and do their best work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer &lt;/strong&gt;on our team, you&#39;ll help lead a technological transition while building your skills at an internationally recognized tech company. You&#39;ll work on the &lt;strong&gt;web application&lt;/strong&gt; that powers Jamf Insights for admins and Managed Service Providers (MSPs) - the companies trusted to manage device fleets on behalf of other businesses.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Jamf Insights &lt;/strong&gt;was born from Jamf Pro, taking its powerful but complex configuration and enrolment capabilities and distilling them into something simpler and more focused.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;With Jamf Insights, admins get:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detailed device inventory paired with the ability to remediate issues directly using MDM commands and management actions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dashboard with device and usage analytics that gives full visibility across a fleet of devices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Device enrolment configuration editing and reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Volume purchasing app usage and scope reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Streamlined workflows that save time and cut down on complexity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
